---------------------------

### noteDigger
- License: GNU GPL version 3 (see refs/noteDigger/LICENSE in a checkout with the reference clone)
- Used for: the functional reference for spectrum analysis, the timing model (seconds internally,
  bar axis on top) and, where noted in individual files, reused code
- Files that carry reused code keep an attribution header naming noteDigger as the origin
- Reused so far: `dataProcess/fft_real.js`, `dataProcess/analyser.js` and
  `core/app_analyser.js` (the STFT path in `namioto/analysis/spectrum.py`),
